:: Left Garden [heaviness] {"position":"812.5,600","size":"100,100"}
# THE GARDEN OF HEAVINESS

(set: $visitedLeft to true)

The air feels thick.

The flowers are wilted.
The trees bend toward the ground.

You notice that the pathway seems much longer than before.

There is a strange stillness here.

You see a watering can beside a dying flower bed.

[[Approach the watering can->Watering Can]]

[[Walk toward the staircase->Endless Staircase]]


:: Library Memory [excess] {"position":"1062.5,1225","size":"100,100"}
# THE FIRST BOOK

You open the first book.

Its pages are filled with handwritten notes.

"I have so many ideas.

Sometimes they arrive faster than I can write them down.

I feel like I can accomplish everything."

You turn the page.

The handwriting becomes increasingly difficult to follow.

(if: $libraryFound is false)[
    (set: $libraryFound to true)
    (set: $memory to $memory + 1)
]
(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)

[[Continue through the library->Unfinished Projects]]


:: Locked Gate [heaviness] {"position":"600,1500","size":"100,100"}
# THE LOCKED GATE

A large iron gate blocks your path.

Three symbols are engraved into the stone.

A key.

A flower.

A letter.

(if: $visitedLeft and $visitedRight)[
You recognize both sides of the garden.
]

(else:)[
You feel that you haven't explored
the entire garden yet.
]

(if: $keyFound)[
The key symbol glows.
]
(else:)[
The key symbol remains dark.
]

(if: $flowerFound)[
The flower symbol glows.
]
(else:)[
The flower symbol remains dark.
]

(if: $letterFound)[
The letter symbol glows.
]
(else:)[
The letter symbol remains dark.
]

(if: $visitedLeft and $visitedRight and $keyFound and $flowerFound and $letterFound)[

All three symbols begin to glow.

The gate unlocks.

(set: $gateOpen to true)

