:: Memory Room [heaviness] {"position":"600,1625","size":"100,100"}
(if: $gateOpen)[
# THE MEMORY ROOM

The gate opens into a strange room.

Objects from both gardens are scattered across the floor.

The watering can.

The golden flower.

The unfinished letter.

You begin to understand that these objects
are connected to something personal.

(if: $letterFound)[
You recognize the handwriting
from the forgotten letter.
]

(if: $clockFound)[
You remember the strange golden clock.
]

(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)

A stone wall contains three circular symbols.

Perhaps they form a puzzle.

[[Examine the three symbols->Three Symbols]]
]
(else:)[
