:: Overgrown Greenhouse [heaviness] {"position":"875,1100","size":"100,100"}
# THE OVERGROWN GREENHOUSE

You enter an old greenhouse.

Plants cover the walls.

Some flowers are blooming.
Others have completely withered.

A gardening table sits in the center.

You notice a small journal beneath the leaves.

Its pages are blank.

You wonder whether someone once spent a lot of time here.

(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)

[[Explore the sleeping flowers->Sleeping Flowers]]


:: Overgrown Path [heaviness] {"position":"600,1125","size":"100,100"}
# THE OVERGROWN PATH

The pathways begin to merge.

The flowers become unfamiliar.

You recognize objects from both sides of the garden.

The air feels different here.

You notice a stone fountain in the distance.

[[Approach the fountain->Forgotten Fountain]]


:: Photograph [clearing] {"position":"1250,1850","size":"100,100"}
''THE PHOTOGRAPH''

You pick up an old photograph.

It shows someone standing in the middle of the garden.

You recognize the flowers.

The trees.

The pathways.

It is the Gardener.

The person whose memories you have been discovering.

On the back of the photograph is a handwritten message:

"Please remember that I am still the same person."

(if: $photoFound is false)[
(set: $photoFound to true)
(set: $memory to $memory + 1)
]

You realize that you have been observing someone's internal world.

But you have never actually met them.

[[Listen to the Gardener->Gardener's Voice]]


:: Portal [clearing] {"position":"1050,1725","size":"100,100"}
# THE PORTAL

(if: $portalOpen)[

The portal begins to shimmer.

Its surface reflects everything
you have experienced.

The wilted flowers.

The golden staircase.

The strange clock.

The forgotten letter.

For a moment, you feel as though
you are floating outside yourself.

A voice whispers:

"Come and see."

[[Step through the portal->Unfamiliar Sky]]

]
(else:)[

The portal remains closed.

[[Return to the clearing->Central Clearing]]

]


