:: Signpost {"position":"875,475","size":"100,100"}
# THE SIGNPOST

Two wooden arrows point in opposite directions.

The left arrow reads:

"THE GARDEN OF HEAVINESS"

The right arrow reads:

"THE GARDEN OF EXCESS"

You feel that both paths are important.

Where will you begin?

[[Explore the left garden->Left Garden]]

[[Explore the right garden->Right Garden]]


:: Sleeping Flowers [heaviness] {"position":"875,1225","size":"100,100"}
# THE SLEEPING FLOWERS

A row of flowers needs watering.

You know what you need to do.

But somehow, beginning feels difficult.

(link: "Try watering the flowers")[
    (set: $weight to $weight + 1)
