]


:: Start {"position":"875,175","size":"100,100"}
# THE SECRET GARDEN

You open your eyes.

Blooming flowers and vines surround you. Tall twisting trees reach toward 
an unfamiliar sky.

You can't remember how you arrived.

The air smells of wet soil and metal gardening tools.

You feel the ground shake, and hear a faint voice.

"Are you lost?"

You turn around.

There is nobody there, just a stone wall overgrown with the garden's plants.

[[Begin exploring->Garden Entrance]]


:: Symbols Unlocked [heaviness] {"position":"1050,1475","size":"100,100"}
(if: $gateOpen and $symbolSolved)[
# THE SYMBOLS UNLOCKED

The key begins to glow.

The flower opens.

The letter unfolds.

A deep sound echoes through the room.

The wall begins to move.

Behind it, you discover a circular clearing.

You have finally reached the center of the maze.

[[Enter the clearing->Central Clearing]]
]
(else:)[
# THE SYMBOLS REMAIN QUIET

The puzzle has not been solved yet.

[[Return to the three symbols->Three Symbols]]
]


:: Talking Flowers [excess] {"position":"1000,725","size":"100,100"}
# THE TALKING FLOWERS

Three flowers begin speaking simultaneously.

The red flower wants you to find a key.

The blue flower wants you to collect a star.

The yellow flower wants you to follow a butterfly.

All three sound equally important.

You try to decide which one to follow.

But another flower begins speaking.

"Why are you standing still?
There is so much to do!"

(set: $ideas to $ideas + 1)

What will you do?

[[Follow the red flower->Golden Flower]]

[[Follow the blue flower->Infinite Staircase]]


:: Three Symbols [heaviness] {"position":"600,1750","size":"100,100"}
(if: $gateOpen)[
# THE THREE SYMBOLS

Three symbols appear before you.

A key.

A flower.

A letter.

An inscription reads:

"Unlock what is hidden.
Remember what has grown.
Read what was left behind."

You think you understand.

(link: "Key, Flower, Letter")[(set: $symbolSolved to true)(go-to: "Symbols Unlocked")]

(link: "Flower, Letter, Key")[ (go-to: "Wrong Sequence") ]

(link: "Letter, Key, Flower")[ (go-to: "Wrong Sequence") ]
]
(else:)[
# THE THREE SYMBOLS

The puzzle is beyond the locked gate. You must open the gate first.

[[Return to the locked gate->Locked Gate]]
]


:: Unfamiliar Sky [clearing] {"position":"1050,1850","size":"100,100"}
# THE UNFAMILIAR SKY

You step through the portal.

Everything changes.

The sky stretches endlessly.

Flowers float above the ground.

The world feels limitless.

For a moment, everything seems possible.

You feel weightless.

You feel as though you could go anywhere
and accomplish anything.

But something about the world feels unfamiliar.

A voice whispers:

"Why would you ever want to leave?"

[[Explore the floating garden->Floating Garden]]


:: Unfinished Projects [excess] {"position":"1187.5,1225","size":"100,100"}
# UNFINISHED PROJECTS

You discover a room filled with unfinished projects.

Paintings.

Books.

Inventions.

Maps.

Everything seems equally important.

(if: $ideas >= 2)[
You find yourself jumping between activities.

Before finishing one, another possibility catches your attention.

The room seems to grow larger.
]

(else:)[
You explore the room.

Each object seems to hold a different possibility.
]

You notice a pathway leading away from the library.

[[Follow the pathway->Overgrown Path]]


:: Watering Can [heaviness] {"position":"725,725","size":"100,100"}
# THE WATERING CAN

A small watering can rests beside a row of dying flowers.

You know what needs to be done.

The flowers need water.

It should be simple.

(link: "Try to lift the watering can")[
    (set: $weight to $weight + 1)
