:: Watering Result [heaviness] {"position":"500,500","size":"100,100"}
# THE FLOWERS

(if: $weight is 1)[
You manage to lift the watering can.

You water one flower.

It took much more effort than expected.

Beneath the can, you discover a small brass key.

(set: $keyFound to true)
]

(if: $weight > 1)[
You have already tried to water the flowers.

The can remains beside them.
]

[[Continue toward the staircase->Endless Staircase]]


:: Wrong Sequence [heaviness] {"position":"900,1475","size":"100,100"}
# THE WRONG SEQUENCE

You touch the symbols.

Nothing happens.

The room becomes quiet again.

Perhaps the inscription
was trying to tell you something.

[[Try again->Three Symbols]]
